Specification tables
--------------------

The constant tables and default CDF tables in src/ are transcribed from the AV1 Bitstream &
Decoding Process Specification, Copyright 2018 The Alliance for Open Media. Licensing terms are
at aomedia.org/license.

Ported code
-----------

src/simd/cdef (mod.rs, avx2.rs, neon.rs) follows the CDEF filter design of dav1d
(src/cdef_tmpl.c, src/x86/cdef*.asm): a padded 16-bit block with a sentinel for unavailable
taps. src/simd/entropy (mod.rs, avx2.rs, neon.rs) follows the vector symbol search and
adaptation of dav1d's msac_decode_symbol_adapt16 (src/x86/msac.asm, src/arm/64/msac.S).
src/symbol.rs (the symbol reader, after src/msac.c) and src/coef.rs (the padded levels
of the coefficient contexts, after src/recon_tmpl.c) carry code ported from dav1d. dav1d is
